{"4030150":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"The Legend of Fancy Realm Remake","steam_appid":4030150,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4778780],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Legend of Fancy Realm Remake is a story driven tactical RPG that brings a long cherished SRPG classic back to life.<br><br>Set in a vast fantasy world shaped by ancient wars and fragile alliances, the game weaves together turn based tactical combat and character focused storytelling, where every decision carries weight.<br><br>Originally released over two decades ago, The Legend of Fancy Realm Remake earned its place as a classic through deep strategy, memorable characters, and emotionally driven narratives.<br><br>This official remake preserves the original spirit while rebuilding its visuals and systems for modern players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/59578df6625d83a666f03a6638e9c4ad.poster.avif?t=1789633396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/59578df6625d83a666f03a6638e9c4ad.webm?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/59578df6625d83a666f03a6638e9c4ad.mp4?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/c4ca2ddc0e977fb4988b3c66f7b57118.avif?t=1789633396\" width=740 height=73 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The continent of Faluosion, once blessed by the gods, became the battleground of the devastating Demon War. Though the war ended long ago, its consequences still shape the present. As new conflicts rise between nations and races, you will step into a world where political ambition, personal belief, and destiny collide.   <br>   <br>The choices you make will influence relationships, events, and the direction of the story.   <br>   <br>The Legend of Fancy Realm Remake inherits and expands upon a classic multi-path narrative structure:   <br><strong>•  Bonds and Trust: <\/strong>Your actions directly affect the relationships between companions, strengthening their loyalty or altering their ultimate fate.    <br><strong>•  Defining Crossroads: <\/strong>When nations stand in opposition, your decisions will lead the story down distinctly different paths.    <br><strong>•  Multiple Endings: <\/strong>Within the long history of Faluosion, your choices will determine whether the world reaches a fleeting peace or descends into deeper ruin.    <br>   <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/b08415e5bd50ab1eca1b338a9431fc5e.poster.avif?t=1789633396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/b08415e5bd50ab1eca1b338a9431fc5e.webm?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/b08415e5bd50ab1eca1b338a9431fc5e.mp4?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br>  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/3a3b5ccefa10b83447fd8f2047a31ad7.avif?t=1789633396\" width=740 height=73 \/><\/span>Victory in Faluosion is not earned through mindless grinding, but through careful planning and decisive action.  <br>  <br><strong>•  Tactical Positioning: <\/strong>Control the flow of battle by managing formations, terrain, and narrow chokepoints where a single decision can change everything.   <br><strong>•  Role-Based Strategy:<\/strong> Each character brings a unique role to the battlefield. Understanding their strengths and weaknesses is the key to overcoming stronger foes.   <br><strong>•  Calculated Combat:<\/strong> Every move counts. Use timing and unique character abilities to turn the tide of difficult encounters.   <br>  <strong> <\/strong> <br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/49c8b51db99c7cc30dd77232dc115987.poster.avif?t=1789633396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/49c8b51db99c7cc30dd77232dc115987.webm?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/49c8b51db99c7cc30dd77232dc115987.mp4?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/a91e60040323a333f6ce17ff1d6aca13.avif?t=1789633396\" width=740 height=73 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character has their own story, personality, and growth path.  <br>  <br><strong>•  Class Transitions:<\/strong> As characters grow, they can unlock powerful job changes and hidden progression routes that redefine their role in battle.   <br><strong>•  Manual Allocation:<\/strong> Take full control of your growth with custom stat allocation and skill learning upon level-up.   <br><strong>•  Meaningful Decisions:<\/strong> Your choices affect more than combat performance. They influence bonds between characters and steer the story toward different outcomes.   <br>  <br>In The Legend of Fancy Realm Remake, growth is not just about power, but about who your characters become.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/ba75cecd49d1b65273faaac3ebd44230.poster.avif?t=1789633396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/ba75cecd49d1b65273faaac3ebd44230.webm?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/ba75cecd49d1b65273faaac3ebd44230.mp4?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/4b1132114c2bf9f8d637e2faafb4b4d2.avif?t=1789633396\" width=740 height=73 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Legend of Fancy Realm Remake stays true to its roots while quietly refining every layer of the experience.  <br>  <br><strong>•  Reimagined Visuals:<\/strong> Rebuilt environments, enhanced character artwork, and refined battle effects bring the world to life.   <br><strong>•  Expanded Narrative: <\/strong>Experience refined story scenes that provide deeper insight into the world’s history with some hidden new stories!   <br><strong>•  Preserved Design: <\/strong>A gameplay experience that respects the logic and challenge of classic SRPGs.   <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/6fbb90200ca6afd4166b312521c8c774.poster.avif?t=1789633396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/6fbb90200ca6afd4166b312521c8c774.webm?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/6fbb90200ca6afd4166b312521c8c774.mp4?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/cca39be6a3dce08a59cef91cf5d155ca.avif?t=1789633396\" width=740 height=73 \/><\/span><strong> •  <\/strong>Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, English, Korean    <\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Legend of Fancy Realm Remake is a story driven tactical RPG that brings a long cherished SRPG classic back to life.<br><br>Set in a vast fantasy world shaped by ancient wars and fragile alliances, the game weaves together turn based tactical combat and character focused storytelling, where every decision carries weight.<br><br>Originally released over two decades ago, The Legend of Fancy Realm Remake earned its place as a classic through deep strategy, memorable characters, and emotionally driven narratives.<br><br>This official remake preserves the original spirit while rebuilding its visuals and systems for modern players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/59578df6625d83a666f03a6638e9c4ad.poster.avif?t=1789633396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/59578df6625d83a666f03a6638e9c4ad.webm?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/59578df6625d83a666f03a6638e9c4ad.mp4?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/c4ca2ddc0e977fb4988b3c66f7b57118.avif?t=1789633396\" width=740 height=73 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The continent of Faluosion, once blessed by the gods, became the battleground of the devastating Demon War. Though the war ended long ago, its consequences still shape the present. As new conflicts rise between nations and races, you will step into a world where political ambition, personal belief, and destiny collide.   <br>   <br>The choices you make will influence relationships, events, and the direction of the story.   <br>   <br>The Legend of Fancy Realm Remake inherits and expands upon a classic multi-path narrative structure:   <br><strong>•  Bonds and Trust: <\/strong>Your actions directly affect the relationships between companions, strengthening their loyalty or altering their ultimate fate.    <br><strong>•  Defining Crossroads: <\/strong>When nations stand in opposition, your decisions will lead the story down distinctly different paths.    <br><strong>•  Multiple Endings: <\/strong>Within the long history of Faluosion, your choices will determine whether the world reaches a fleeting peace or descends into deeper ruin.    <br>   <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/b08415e5bd50ab1eca1b338a9431fc5e.poster.avif?t=1789633396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/b08415e5bd50ab1eca1b338a9431fc5e.webm?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/b08415e5bd50ab1eca1b338a9431fc5e.mp4?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br>  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/3a3b5ccefa10b83447fd8f2047a31ad7.avif?t=1789633396\" width=740 height=73 \/><\/span>Victory in Faluosion is not earned through mindless grinding, but through careful planning and decisive action.  <br>  <br><strong>•  Tactical Positioning: <\/strong>Control the flow of battle by managing formations, terrain, and narrow chokepoints where a single decision can change everything.   <br><strong>•  Role-Based Strategy:<\/strong> Each character brings a unique role to the battlefield. Understanding their strengths and weaknesses is the key to overcoming stronger foes.   <br><strong>•  Calculated Combat:<\/strong> Every move counts. Use timing and unique character abilities to turn the tide of difficult encounters.   <br>  <strong> <\/strong> <br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/49c8b51db99c7cc30dd77232dc115987.poster.avif?t=1789633396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/49c8b51db99c7cc30dd77232dc115987.webm?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/49c8b51db99c7cc30dd77232dc115987.mp4?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/a91e60040323a333f6ce17ff1d6aca13.avif?t=1789633396\" width=740 height=73 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character has their own story, personality, and growth path.  <br>  <br><strong>•  Class Transitions:<\/strong> As characters grow, they can unlock powerful job changes and hidden progression routes that redefine their role in battle.   <br><strong>•  Manual Allocation:<\/strong> Take full control of your growth with custom stat allocation and skill learning upon level-up.   <br><strong>•  Meaningful Decisions:<\/strong> Your choices affect more than combat performance. They influence bonds between characters and steer the story toward different outcomes.   <br>  <br>In The Legend of Fancy Realm Remake, growth is not just about power, but about who your characters become.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/ba75cecd49d1b65273faaac3ebd44230.poster.avif?t=1789633396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/ba75cecd49d1b65273faaac3ebd44230.webm?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/ba75cecd49d1b65273faaac3ebd44230.mp4?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/4b1132114c2bf9f8d637e2faafb4b4d2.avif?t=1789633396\" width=740 height=73 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Legend of Fancy Realm Remake stays true to its roots while quietly refining every layer of the experience.  <br>  <br><strong>•  Reimagined Visuals:<\/strong> Rebuilt environments, enhanced character artwork, and refined battle effects bring the world to life.   <br><strong>•  Expanded Narrative: <\/strong>Experience refined story scenes that provide deeper insight into the world’s history with some hidden new stories!   <br><strong>•  Preserved Design: <\/strong>A gameplay experience that respects the logic and challenge of classic SRPGs.   <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/6fbb90200ca6afd4166b312521c8c774.poster.avif?t=1789633396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/6fbb90200ca6afd4166b312521c8c774.webm?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/6fbb90200ca6afd4166b312521c8c774.mp4?t=1789633396\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/extras\/cca39be6a3dce08a59cef91cf5d155ca.avif?t=1789633396\" width=740 height=73 \/><\/span><strong> •  <\/strong>Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, English, Korean    <\/p>","short_description":"The Legend of Fancy Realm Remake is a story driven tactical RPG that brings a long cherished SRPG classic back to life. Set in a vast fantasy world shaped by ancient wars, the game weaves together turn based tactical combat and character focused storytelling, where every decision carries weight.","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Japanese, Korean<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/d0cf2fdb5f7be154aef2a6c5cdacb32d3dc9538a\/header.jpg?t=1789633396","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/60083c0d62503d9ba3428fe7f7df86b4018b39cc\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1789633396","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4030150\/60083c0d62503d9ba3428fe7f7df86b4018b39cc\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1789633396","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows® 10 or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 